                <p class="dateAesteticTitle2">PRESS RELEASE <br>Aug 03, 2026</p>
                <h3>Interview with debut actor Dimitri Fontaine about Blue Shades</h3>
                <p class="dateAesteticTitle2">By Zafira Hafiz</p>

            </div>
            <div class="col s12 m3"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col s12 m2"></div>
            <div class="col s12 m8">
